   "duree_statut": "estimée",
   "langues": {
    "fuf": {
     "texte": "Fuufaare maaɗa ɗon ƴiwoyi dow laawol laaɓal, dokkal boo ɗon dilli. Nder laawol ngol, walaa goɗɗo ɗon holla ma ko'e mon. Mi ɗon wara bee maaɗa haa ɓaawo wakkati, nden saare ma boo walaa alkawal.",
